<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Strasbourg Guide: 11 places – La Petite France, cathedral, Neustadt &amp; winstub – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. La Petite France</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come before 9 a.m. – then you have lanes and canals almost to yourself. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>7.74218,48.58136,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Barrage Vauban</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go up shortly before sunset – then the light lies warm on the cathedral. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>7.738,48.5796,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Strasbourg Cathedral (Notre-Dame)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Combine the tower with the astronomical clock. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>7.75105,48.58189,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Place Kléber, Place Gutenberg &amp; Maison Kammerzell</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go in the evening when the squares are lit. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>7.74975,48.58197,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Palais Rohan &amp; museums</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · A perfect rainy-day tip right next to the cathedral. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>7.75265,48.58101,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Boat tour on the Ill</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Book in the morning, then the light is lovely and the boats less full. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>7.75209,48.58017,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Neustadt – the German quarter</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Walk from Place de la République towards the university. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>7.73882,48.58343,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Jardin des Deux Rives – bridge to Germany</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Take the tram to Port du Rhin and walk across the bridge. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/strasbourg/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>7.80025,48.56762,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
